{"timestamp": 1772831970487.3635, "start_timestamp": 1772831970483, "page": "pages3/findDetails/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/supply-demand/comment/add", "data": {"supplyDemandId": "2030026283325259778", "content": "轻松的帽如光，常常洗便能照亮前行的路。愿我们都能欣然拿清甜的牙刷，活成自己喜欢的模样。喜欢稳拥抱面包的感觉，简单又凉。短筷如光，慢遇便能照亮前行的路。在柔软的时光里，翻阅客厅是最柔软的事 (be kind to yourself)。慢慢熬充实的暖被窝，感受生活的小美好。晨光教会我刚写，不负时光不负自己。于暖心的日常里，背地铁是藏在烟火里的温柔与浪漫。空眼镜如光，淡淡地等便能照亮前行的路。在全的岁月里，炒手机是对。"}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0d157sFa1AxrjL0ZexGa1wLxSm057sF1", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer 137a42b55ff44432b251fac0c14a6dd7"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1772831970517, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": 1, "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Fri, 06 Mar 2026 21:19:30 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "Connection": "keep-alive", "appservice-request-id": "3463"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
{"timestamp": 1772831970528.5227, "start_timestamp": 1772831970518, "page": "pages3/findDetails/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/card/supplyDemand/get", "data": {"id": "2030026283325259778"}, "method": "GET", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0d157sFa1AxrjL0ZexGa1wLxSm057sF1", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer 137a42b55ff44432b251fac0c14a6dd7"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1772831970612, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"id": "1960560586298163202", "userId": 1615, "name": "邵昆仑测试环境", "mobile": "17681122808", "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg", "tag1": "建设理想国", "tag2": "自由追梦人", "identityId": null, "identityType": null, "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "address": "上海市青浦区虹桥世界中心E幢3楼301室", "visitCount": 11, "exchangeStatus": -1, "cardType": 10, "contactId": null, "ipArea": "上海市", "persionalIntroduce": "我是一名深耕行业的追光者🌟，始终坚信厚积薄发的力量⏳。在无数挑战与机遇的淬炼中，我用时间验证了坚持的价值——每一次勇敢尝试都沉淀为破局底气💪，每一份勤勉付出都酝酿着温柔回响🌱。\n\n我习惯在坎坷中寻找生长缝隙🌿，以专业沉淀应对复杂，用韧性突破瓶颈。技术攻坚时深耕领域核心，市场拓展中开拓边界，始终以\"慢即是快\"的节奏打磨细节🔨，在坚持中沉淀竞争力，在沉淀中捕捉时代机遇。\n\n我将持续以专业为基、以热爱为翼，在时光长河中保持清醒热爱🌊，以从容之心面对未知，以坚定之姿奔赴热爱，让每一步坚持都成为未来序章📖。", "isMine": true, "isOfficial": false, "cardShareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260306/fd603bcb1cec6bbf51adca04f7ae04097b77965aea34ca04d42e7399d2a9258e.png", "memberStatus": true, "memberExpireDate": "2026/03/08", "supplyDemandId": "2030026283325259778", "cardId": "1960560586298163202", "title": null, "description": "我发布了一个【旅行如诗，懒洋洋地品味。烟火。】活动，快来参加吧~", "type": "activity", "createTime": 1772830957000, "dateTimeString": "16分钟", "likeCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "collectionCount": 0, "shareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260307/7f9b635fdab0c63f358468b5bdbbe948a487ec41a90e4f42d9c8f0174eccac4b.png", "isLike":